<div class="faq">
  <details open><summary>Is the free plan actually free?</summary><p>Yes. The assessment, your 30-day roadmap, the starter library and a few AI runs every month are free with no card. Upgrade only if it's helping.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who is 127 for?</summary><p>Mostly people launching their first business, often in their late teens or twenties, wondering how to get started and what successful founders know that they don't. Early-stage founders who've launched and need better marketing, sales and systems fit too. The assessment routes you to the right track.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is this a course?</summary><p>No. There are no hours of video to sit through. It's a working system: short playbooks paired with an output, AI tools that apply them to your business, and templates you can use today.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How is the AI different from a regular chatbot?</summary><p>It's built on Eli's playbook: his principles, his frameworks and the 127 library, and it knows your stage, goal and constraints from onboarding. It's direct and will push back on a weak plan. It won't give financial, legal or tax advice.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How does the Founder's Circle work?</summary><p>It's a group of up to <%= circleCapacity %> heavily committed, driven founders, by application. There's a weekly call with Eli, questions submitted in advance, commitments at the end of every call, and two in-person gatherings a year. It's group guidance, not unlimited one-to-one consulting.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I cancel anytime?</summary><p>Yes. Cancel online anytime from Billing. No call or email needed. You keep access until the end of the period you paid for.</p></details>
</div>
